","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"los-angeles","name":"Los Angeles"},{"slug":"nipsey-hussle","name":"Nipsey Hussle"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/lauren-london-nipsey-hussle-eulogy.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/lauren-london-nipsey-hussle-eulogy.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/660859582365872129/ruEQx3vC_normal.jpg","https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/1112761362814566402/pu/img/0jvuex_PKh-Btpuj?format=jpg&amp;name=small"],"readingTimeMin":3,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/lauren-london-delivers-open-letter-on-nipseys-birthday/"}